flowchart LR

  BRZ["BRONZE<br/>Raw data lands<br/>PyAirbyte, one command · committed sample · 45,228 rows"]
  SLV["SILVER<br/>A human decides meaning<br/>cleanup contract, ODCS · human-owned SQL · 44,721 clean lines"]
  GLD["GOLD<br/>The engine builds the star<br/>mapping contract in · 12 dbt models out · never DDL, PRs only"]
  ANS["ANSWERS<br/>Agents answer with context<br/>typed mart, MCP server · read-only, three layers · meaning one join away"]

  BRZ -->|"profile, propose, approve"| SLV
  SLV -->|"contract, engine, regeneration PR"| GLD
  GLD -->|"steered to the typed mart"| ANS

  GOV["EVERY CHANGE IS A REVIEWED PULL REQUEST<br/>Two narrow agents draft contracts. Three CI gates judge human and agent work identically.<br/>Failures stop the line; nothing an agent writes reaches the warehouse unreviewed."]

  BRZ ~~~ GOV
  ANS ~~~ GOV

